# The worker image builds from the REPO ROOT — see the note in api/Dockerfile.
# Without this, 214 MB of `api/.venv` is uploaded as build context on every
# deploy and then thrown away, because the image builds its own venv with uv.

**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
**/.next
.git
.vercel
web/
docs/
stories/
stamp-system-design-handoff/
MEMORY/
.remember/
*.mp4
*.zip
